    "After setting up the insulin type and bolus speed, you will see all the found Dana pumps. Select the pump you want to link with %1$@." : {
      "comment" : "General subtext for dana (1: appName)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "بعد إعداد نوع الأنسولين وسرعة البلعة، ستظهر لك شاشة تحتوي على جميع مضخات دانا الموجودة. حدد المضخة التي تريد ربطها مع %1$@."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Efter opsætning af insulintype og bolushastighed, får man vist en skærm med alle fundne Dana-pumper. Vælg den pumpe, der skal forbindes med %1$@."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nachdem Sie den Insulintyp und die Bolusgeschwindigkeit eingestellt haben, wird ein Bildschirm mit allen gefundenen Dana-Pumpen angezeigt. Wählen Sie die Pumpe aus, die Sie mit %1$@verknüpfen möchten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After setting up the insulin type and bolus speed, you will see a screen with all found Dana pumps. Select the pump you want to link with %1$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después de configurar el tipo de insulina y la velocidad del bolo, verás una pantalla con todas las bombas Dana encontradas. Seleccione la bomba que desea vincular con %1$@."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kun olet määrittänyt insuliinityypin ja bolusnopeuden, näet näytön, jossa näkyvät kaikki löydetyt Dana-pumput. Valitse pumppu, jonka haluat yhdistää osoitteeseen %1$@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Après avoir configuré le type d'insuline et la vitesse du bolus, vous verrez un écran avec toutes les pompes Dana trouvées. Sélectionnez la pompe que vous souhaitez relier à %1$@."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After setting up the insulin type and bolus speed, you will see a screen with all found Dana pumps. Select the pump you want to link with %1$@."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After setting up the insulin type and bolus speed, you will see a screen with all found Dana pumps. Select the pump you want to link with %1$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dopo aver impostato il tipo di insulina e la velocità del bolo, verrà visualizzata una schermata con tutti i microinfusori Dana trovati. Selezionare il microinfusore che si desidera collegare a %1$@."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
